# Packages installed by provision-arch.sh with `pacman -Syu --needed`.
#
# One per line, comments and blank lines stripped. This is the laptop's manifest
# and NOT a fleet list — the Debian boxes have packages/apt, and the overlap is
# deliberate but partial. Adding something here does not put it on chiki.
#
# Everything below is in the official repos. AUR packages live in packages/aur
# and are built by hand after a PKGBUILD review; keep it that way.

