# --- science ---------------------------------------------------------------
julia               # extra/julia, not juliaup from the AUR: juliaup installs
                    # toolchains into ~/.julia outside pacman, which puts them
                    # outside snapper's coverage — and rollback is the whole
                    # reason this machine is btrfs. If a chain has to match a
                    # cluster's Julia exactly, add juliaup on top then.

